  TurnStartDialogue:
  - My go.
  - Deal 'em.
  - Let's see what I got.
  - '''Bout time.'
  ThinkingDialogue:
  - Hmm...
  - Don't rush me.
  - Hold your feathers.
  - Which one...
  TargetedDialogue:
  - You looking at me?
  - Big mistake.
  - Bring it.
  BluffingDialogue:
  - Read 'em and weep.
  - You can't beat this.
  - Solid gold.
  - Too easy.
